    "body": "## Problem\r\n\r\n`:restart` is extremely verbose when it fails:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"865\" height=\"561\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/60064328-a30d-4645-a08f-488635dd6221\" />\r\n\r\nCompare to `:restart!`:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"865\" height=\"561\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7c3d8ec8-9e10-4dc4-b2e6-65f838bafe93\" />\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nBring `:restart` in line with `:restart!`'s error messages.",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-15T23:05:46Z",
